│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ heap_packing_refinement                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the quadratic Python scan used to select the least-loaded non-full pack with a    │
│                          │ capacity-aware min-heap. This preserves the LPT-style greedy construction while reducing  │
│                          │ selection cost from O(num_groups * num_packs) to O(num_groups * log(num_packs)) per       │
│                          │ layer.                                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ After the greedy placement, perform one strictly improving swap between the heaviest and  │
│                          │ lightest packs. The swap preserves the exact item count in every pack and is accepted     │
│                          │ only when it reduces the maximum pack load, so it cannot degrade the packing objective.   │
│                          │ This inexpensive local-search step addresses common greedy-LPT placement errors and       │
│                          │ improves GPU/node load balance without an expensive global combinatorial search.          │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
