│ patch_description        │ Replace the Python linear scan over every non-full pack with a min-heap. The previous     │
│                          │ LPT-style assignment selected the least-loaded eligible pack in O(num_packs) time per     │
│                          │ group, while a heap performs the identical selection in O(log(num_packs)). Converting     │
│                          │ sorted indices and row weights to Python lists also avoids repeated CPU tensor scalar     │
│                          │ extraction and tensor arithmetic inside the innermost loop. This preserves the            │
│                          │ balanced-packing policy while substantially reducing rearrangement overhead for many      │
│                          │ groups, nodes, or GPUs.                                                                   │
