│ patch_name               │ uniform_identity_fast_path                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Add a strictly gated identity-mapping fast path for the common degenerate case where no   │
│                          │ redundant replicas are requested and every logical expert has exactly equal recorded load │
│                          │ within each layer. In this case, every valid placement with equal expert slots per        │
│                          │ GPU/node has identical load balance, so hierarchical group packing, sorting, heap         │
│                          │ scheduling, inverse permutations, and scatter construction are unnecessary. The returned  │
│                          │ identity layout preserves one replica per logical expert and gives every GPU the same     │
│                          │ number of equal-load experts. The equality gate is exact rather than heuristic, so skewed │
│                          │ or merely near-uniform workloads retain the existing balancing behavior.                  │
