│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ uniform_identity_fastpath                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Add a strictly gated identity-layout fast path when there is no replication and every     │
│                          │ logical expert in each layer has identical load. In this case every valid placement has   │
│                          │ the same expert and GPU load, so hierarchical group packing, inverse permutations, and    │
│                          │ greedy scheduling cannot improve balance. Constructing the canonical mapping directly     │
│                          │ eliminates the relatively expensive CPU scheduling path while preserving the required     │
